    // Scope: admin. Since: 3.7.0.
    Json profile_use(const ProfileUseArgs &args) { return c.call("profile_use", args.json()); }

    // Answers the account's settings profiles, as Settings > Profiles lists them: each one's name, whether it is in use, when it last changed and when it was last synced, and where they are kept (this computer, or Bentrix's server too on Plus and Pro). A profile holds every setting, default and template, never the work.
